                                "example_id": "5cec643a-20ea-4b83-99ba-2c5957945fa4",
                                "sense_id": "ee99ae9f-b843-3359-b02d-c91ee9964501",
                                "text": "Poetry for me wove its own spell to secure me against all 'unlusts' - all criticisms - even against joylessness: I was set apart; in safety; as secure - in this way - as he. Who was in that audience, I wonder now? That all was success is certain."
